      "description": "Banda papel con cabecera roja y frases separadas por cuadrados azules.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-ticker\"><span class=\"ds-k\">ÚLTIMA HORA</span><span class=\"ds-t\"><span><b>1,4 M</b> reproducciones</span><span>Sin salir en cámara</span></span></div>",
      "css": ":host{--studio:#12141B;--paper:#F2F4F8;--ink:#12141B;--ink-2:#4A5063;--rule:#D5D9E3;--blue:#2A44F5;--yellow:#FFD84D;--live:#D92020;--on-studio:#F2F4F8;--on-studio-2:#A9AEC0;--studio-line:#2A2E3B;--sans:'Bricolage Grotesque',system-ui,sans-serif;--mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;--ease:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)} .ds-ticker{display:flex;align-items:stretch;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);overflow:hidden} .ds-k{display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--live);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-stretch:78%;letter-spacing:.05em;font-size:.78rem;padding:0 14px} .ds-t{display:flex;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:700;font-stretch:85%;font-size:1.02rem;padding-block:11px} .ds-t span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding-inline:18px} .ds-t span::after{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--blue)} .ds-t b{color:var(--blue)} .ds-ticker:hover .ds-t b{color:var(--ink)}"
